			<div class="content" id="post-content-2457985">
									

<p>A very good article, but there's something that is not clear to me:<br />
Is the hotel containment for SCP-2788 only, or for the whole population of Huaxi?<br />
If only for the SCP, why so huge a containment?<br />
If for everyone&#8230; I feel sorry for them, going from quaint little houses with gardens to a huge skyscraper&#8230;! ;&gt;<br />
(In fact I feel sorry for SCP-2788 too. Why contain him apart from his villagers?)</p>
<p>Still, an interesting take on 'cult of personality', and on the passage from traditional to modern thinking/architecture. +1!</p>

